# English only

Every file written in this repository must be English only:

- README, docs, epics, AGENTS, rules, skills
- Code comments and user-facing strings in docs
- Package metadata descriptions

Do not write Greek or any other language into repository files. Chat with humans may use other languages; on-disk Argos files may not.
